    "Tadpole": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tadpole"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tadpole manages the mods in “Documents/Larian Studios/Baldur's Gate 3”. The game creates that folder the first time it runs: start it, reach the main menu, quit, then come back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tadpole gère les mods dans « Documents/Larian Studios/Baldur’s Gate 3 ». Le jeu crée ce dossier à son premier lancement : lancez-le, allez jusqu’au menu principal, quittez, puis revenez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take it out of the load order": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le retirer de l’ordre de chargement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game rewrites its mod list when it quits, which would undo this change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le jeu réécrit sa liste de mods en quittant, ce qui annulerait ce changement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then click **Mod Manager Download** on a mod's Files tab: Tadpole downloads and installs it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ensuite, cliquez sur **Mod Manager Download** dans l’onglet Files d’un mod : Tadpole le télécharge et l’installe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link is for “%@”. Only Baldur's Gate 3 mods can be installed here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce lien est pour « %@ ». Seuls les mods de Baldur’s Gate 3 peuvent être installés ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This mod uses Norbyte's Script Extender, which isn't available on macOS. Its scripted features won't work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce mod utilise le Script Extender de Norbyte, qui n’existe pas sur macOS. Ses fonctions scriptées ne marcheront pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This save is still in the game. Restoring puts the backed-up version in its place; the current one goes to the Trash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette sauvegarde est toujours dans le jeu. La restauration met la copie à sa place ; l’actuelle va dans la corbeille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réessayer"
          }
        }
      }
